{"id": "EUVD-2026-98062", "enisaUuid": "ad3598af-be85-300a-8d8d-8ecc08cc9c79", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.113.0 and 16.x before 16.24.0 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability in a profile field that is rendered without escaping into portal pages. Low-privilege attackers can store malicious script in the field that executes in the browser of any administrator viewing those pages, enabling administrator account takeover.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:22:36", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T14:35:57", "baseScore": 8.5, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-rg9g-c26v-cw27", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-erpnext-before-15.113.0-stored-xss-via-profile-field-in-portal-pages"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109671", "GHSA-24f3-935v-8wmm"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "15523971-6ae3-342d-89d5-df73eaa3026d", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.113.0"}, {"id": "1ebc4441-2822-309e-8a23-cb0f5d29dc9e", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.24.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c9865b24-fce7-3cbc-a48d-b5776a4d4ec6", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}